 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20220303085328/https://benjamins.com/catalog/chlel.xxxii\">Archived</a> 2022-03-03 at the <a href=\"/wiki/Wayback_Machine\" title=\"Wayback Machine\">Wayback Machine</a> Landscapes of Realism: Rethinking Literary Realism in Comparative Perspectives. Volume I: Mapping Realism. (2021). Netherlands: John Benjamins Publishing Company. Retrieved 2021-03-03.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>"}}